 It was great to be back in Ballhalla last night to celebrate the first birthday for Violet, the Valkyries' mascot. Today's AI+ is 1,137 words, a 4.5-minute read.

 Situational awareness: Anthropic is in talks to acquire Nvidia-backed AI infrastructure startup Decart for roughly $6 billion, in what could be a sign the company wants to boost chip efficiency pre-IPO, per Bloomberg.

 
 
