 5. + This 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Mady here, dying to talk to the investor who told the Financial Times that Anthropic may deserve a $3 trillion valuation.

 An investor said: "If Anthropic is growing 800 per cent a year, you'd think at the incredibly low end they would trade at 30 times [revenue]," and "That would make them a $3tn company." That would be about triple the valuation of the largest IPO in history, SpaceX. 
 
